ory":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 50% of normal in Nov-Dec and 59% in Aug-Sep. For 2026 so far, May to June came in at 172% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 13662 had its driest year in 1954 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
